  "solution": {
    "text": "<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8757;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#38;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mfenced open=\"|\" close=\"|\" separators=\"|\"><mrow><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>-</mo><mn>3</mn><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfenced></math> both are continuous <math><mo>&#8704;</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>&#8712;</mo><mi>R</mi></math><br /><math><mo>&#8756;</mo><mi>f</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfenced></math> is continuous <math><mo>&#8704;</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>&#8712;</mo><mi>R</mi></math><br />Now,&nbsp;<math><mfenced close=\"|\" open=\"|\" separators=\"|\"><mrow><msup><mrow><mi>x</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mo>-</mo><mn>3</mn><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mfenced close=\"|\" open=\"|\" separators=\"|\"><mrow><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfenced></mrow></mfenced></math><br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8756;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>f</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mi>x</mi></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mfenced open=\"{\" close=\"\" separators=\"|\"><mtable columnalign=\"left\"><mtr><mtd><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfenced><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfenced></mtd><mtd><mo>:</mo></mtd><mtd><mi>x</mi><mo>&#8712;</mo><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mo>-</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#8734;</mi><mo>,</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>&#8746;</mo><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo>,</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#8734;</mi></mrow></mfenced></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd><mo>-</mo><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfenced><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfenced></mtd><mtd><mo>:</mo></mtd><mtd><mi>x</mi><mo>&#8712;</mo><mfenced open=\"[\" close=\"]\" separators=\"|\"><mn>1,2</mn></mfenced></mtd></mtr></mtable></mfenced></math><br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>f</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mi>x</mi></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mfenced open=\"{\" close=\"\" separators=\"|\"><mtable columnalign=\"left\"><mtr><mtd><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced><msup><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfenced><mn>2</mn></msup></mtd><mtd><mo>:</mo></mtd><mtd><mi>x</mi><mo>&#8712;</mo><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mo>-</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#8734;</mi><mo>,</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>&#8746;</mo><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo>,</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#8734;</mi></mrow></mfenced></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd><mo>-</mo><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced><msup><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfenced><mn>2</mn></msup></mtd><mtd><mo>:</mo></mtd><mtd><mi>x</mi><mo>&#8712;</mo><mfenced open=\"[\" close=\"]\" separators=\"|\"><mn>1,2</mn></mfenced></mtd></mtr></mtable></mfenced></math><br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mi>f</mi><mo>'</mo></msup><mfenced><mi>x</mi></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mfenced open=\"{\" close=\"\"><mtable columnalign=\"left\" equalrows=\"true\" equalcolumns=\"true\"><mtr><mtd><mfenced><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>&#8722;</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced><mn>2</mn><mfenced><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>&#8722;</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>+</mo><msup><mfenced><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>&#8722;</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfenced><mn>2</mn></msup></mtd><mtd><mo>:</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>&#8712;</mo><mfenced><mrow><mo>&#8722;</mo><mo>&#8734;</mo><mo>,</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>&#8746;</mo><mfenced><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo>,</mo><mo>&#8734;</mo></mrow></mfenced></mtd><mtd/></mtr><mtr><mtd><mo>&#8722;</mo><mfenced><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>&#8722;</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced><mn>2</mn><mfenced><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>&#8722;</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>&#8722;</mo><msup><mfenced><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>&#8722;</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfenced><mn>2</mn></msup></mtd><mtd><mo>:</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>&#8712;</mo><mfenced><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfenced></mtd><mtd/></mtr></mtable></mfenced></math><br />Clearly,&nbsp;<math> <mrow> <msup> <mi>f</mi> <mo>&#8242;</mo> </msup> <mfenced> <mrow> <msup> <mn>2</mn> <mo>&#8722;</mo> </msup> </mrow> </mfenced><mo>=</mo><mi>f</mi><mtext>'</mtext><mfenced> <mrow> <msup> <mn>2</mn> <mo>+</mo> </msup> </mrow> </mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>f</mi><mfenced> <mi>x</mi> </mfenced></mrow> </math> is differentiable at <math><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn></math><br />and&nbsp;<math> <mrow> <msup> <mi>f</mi> <mo>&#8242;</mo> </msup> <mfenced> <mrow> <msup> <mn>1</mn> <mo>&#8722;</mo> </msup> </mrow> </mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>,</mo><msup> <mi>f</mi> <mo>&#8242;</mo> </msup> <mfenced> <mrow> <msup> <mn>1</mn> <mo>+</mo> </msup> </mrow> </mfenced><mo>=</mo><mo>&#8722;</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>f</mi><mfenced> <mi>x</mi> </mfenced></mrow> </math> is non-differentiable at <math><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></math>"
  }
